        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Argh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(So dizzy...! But I can see... and hear.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I can't feel... my ankle.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's so quiet. Where did everyone go?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(......)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Silent as the grave... Did the rioters just leave me here?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaah?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry! You startled me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You... I know you. You're from Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "GreyThroat, Operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your voice down. We took care of the rebels in this area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Took care of them...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even at this point, you still don't see them as the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, most of them are still alive. Handed over to Officer Severin Hawthorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, um... What about Miss Folinic?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's fine. I sent another operator to help her. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Atro really... sacrifice herself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes. I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That explains the way Folinic has been acting...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a few operators won't be able to retake this neighborhood on their own. We should fall back to the town center and regroup.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Can you walk? You injured your ankle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I can try. Ow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, let me help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One more question, Miss Tatjana. When I came here with Atro, Wolumonde was still thriving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what happened to all the Gendarmerie? There isn't a single one left in town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
