    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hng!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put down your weapon. Look at yourself. You don't even have a decent set of clothes. You're going to fight like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you outsiders know? What do you even get out of helping those noble puppets?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing. I'm not interested in your politics at all. But... are you a Winterwisp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Winterwisp...? Hah. I'm not aboriginal, but I do acknowledge their struggle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you? Dr. Atro was a good person, but you? You're just here to help them crush us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde, no, all of Leithanien is rotten to the core! Today they burn the Infected alive, tomorrow it will be the entire working class!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's your proof?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's not a single Gendarmerie in Wolumonde! Not one!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you think that is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde and several surrounding towns formed a collective settlement network. When the Catastrophe struck, there were not enough Gendarmerie to care for all of the\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh really? If it was that simple, nobody would mind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough stalling. Out with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a wedding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "A wedding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some great nobleman in his high tower married the only daughter of another nobleman, so they sent all the Gendarmerie over to the nearest nomadic city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how long do you think the aristocrats' drunken revelries are gonna last? You wanna guess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh and I almost forgot about the part where the nobles argued back and forth for a month about whose city should move to whose territory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "So our Gendarmerie had to go stand around some fancy mansions to boost a fortunate son's ego, and maybe keep out the riffraff. Isn't that funny? Are you laughing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I'm not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's not funny. But that still doesn't give me any leads as to the fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_067"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it: who's going to set fire to a medical camp that treats Infected? Would the Infected do that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "It could only be someone who wants to see the Infected suffer. You should be on our side\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014The side of Reunion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rebellious Townsfolk"
    },
    {
