        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm. But it looks like the other side won't give us the chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Reunion really is here, there's no need for a light touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger that. However, Folinic, you should stay here and tend to the wounded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd rather get in there my\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lisa, Operator Suzuran, is not a fully accredited medic operator. Only you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You should prioritize protecting the innocent over defeating the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Folinic... You should stay here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep fighting that hard, that aggressively, you won't be you anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... okay. I'll... stay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
